<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi's Tabuk Cement Co H1 pre-tax profit dips.</title>
<headline>Saudi's Tabuk Cement Co H1 pre-tax profit dips.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			 (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	   7.68   vs   14.80</p>
<p> Income		    10.67   vs   18.77</p>
<p> Expenses		   2.98   vs    3.96</p>
<p> Shareholders' equity 784.10   vs  766.50</p>
<p> Assets		 1,098.60   vs  858.92</p>
<p>Full Name: Tabuk Cement Company.</p>
<p>Note - The company is one of eight cement firms in Saudi Arabia.</p>
<p>-- Bahrain newsroom 973-524424.</p>
</text>
